    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: 'In the world of Shanhai, everything a character does depends on the flow of the five elements, and how they generate and counter each other often decides who wins. Your main element is the element whose effects come to you most easily, and it usually shapes which fights and conversations you handle best.

    The element tokens a character carries are the key resource in combat and social encounters. Main-element tokens are the only tokens that come back on their own as the story moves on, and the effects of items, equipment and abilities are usually tied to the user''s main element.

    Choose the element that fits how you imagine your character. For the strongest team, talk it over and try to pick different main elements.'
