    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.1
  m_Text: 'Your species is something your character is born with. Species differ greatly in culture and customs, appearance and innate abilities.

    Your species can also affect how the creatures you meet treat you. Some spirits hold great affection, or great hostility, towards particular species. When you meet them, socialising may come easier, or a fight may turn more dangerous.'
--- !u!222 &1359186367
